 November 2025.\nWhat it cannot show: The concentration of contracts near the legal limit does not prove improper actions. It could reflect market conditions, budget constraints, or genuine needs. Statistical patterns alone do not indicate wrongdoing without further investigation.\nWhat can be checked: Check the dates and values of contracts [1] and [2] to ensure they align with the body's needs. Verify if multiple contracts serve the same purpose and if the awardees are consistently meeting the body's requirements.","origen_es":"modelo","origen_en":"modelo","modelo":"Qwen3-4B (Q4_K_M, llama.cpp)","regla":"ss","citas":["usAFV75YCbnIGlsa0Wad%2Bw%3D%3D","55IuPmYSVy8UqXM96WStVA%3D%3D","g9e%2BwUAQN5UwYTJJ03sHog%3D%3D"],"generado":"2026-11-16"}}